NAME
     wget - fetch a URL to a file

SYNOPSIS
     wget [-q] [-S] [-O FILE] URL [FILE]

DESCRIPTION
     wget fetches an http:// URL and writes it to a file named after the
     URL, or to the file given.

OPTIONS
     -q          say nothing
     -S          print the response headers
     -O FILE     write there; - is standard output

SEE ALSO
     curl(1), https(1)
